 # larder
 
 Members of a neighbourhood pantry order what they need and pay by card. See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) to work on it.
+
+Install dependencies with `python3 -m pip install -r requirements.txt`. Set `DATABASE_URL` to the shared Postgres
+database and `LARDER_SESSION_KEY` to the same secret on each web server. Before deploying the session code, apply
+the schema with `psql "$DATABASE_URL" -f larder/sessions.sql`.
